  "plan": {
    "goal": "Quantify competitive inhibition of UGT2B7 by a small-molecule inhibitor against testosterone glucuronidation.",
    "rationale": "UGT2B7 is incubated with testosterone at [S]=776.2 µM (Km=540.7 µM) in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki=107.9 µM) at [I]=39.3 µM, Vmax=8.0915 µmol/min. Under competitive inhibition the fractional activity is v_i/v_0 = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); apparent Km = Km(1+[I]/Ki); run-condition IC50 (Cheng-Prusoff) = Ki(1+[S]/Km). The inhibited velocity is fractional activity × Vmax and percent inhibition is (1 − fractional activity) × 100.",
